{#- Site footer: copyright, the "Press G for Design Mode" hint (see HIDDEN-FEATURES.md → Designer mode) and
    a "Back to top" link. The hint is hidden on touch-only screens, which have no G key to press; "Back to top"
    stays (.footer__hint / .footer__top in home.css and work.css). "#top" is the homepage hero; on other pages
    the browser treats "#top" as the top of the page. #}
<footer class="footer">
  <div class="container footer__row">
    <p>© 2026 {{ site.name }}. All rights reserved</p>
    <p class="footer__end">
      <span class="footer__hint">Press <kbd>G</kbd> for Design Mode<span class="footer__dot" aria-hidden="true">•</span></span>
      {#- The arrow sits in a key cap like the G above (.footer__key shares the kbd styles). #}
      {#- #}<a class="footer__top" href="#top">Back to top<span class="footer__key" aria-hidden="true">
        {#- #}<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="14" height="14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" focusable="false">
          <path d="M22 12C22 17.5228 17.5228 22 12 22C6.47715 22 2 17.5228 2 12C2 6.47715 6.47715 2 12 2C17.5228 2 22 6.47715 22 12Z" />
          <path d="M12 15.5V9.5" />
          <path d="M9 11.5L12 8.5L15 11.5" />
        </svg></span></a>
    </p>
  </div>
</footer>
